{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a world of tactical duels and dark destiny. Learn the basics of gameplay, uncover the secrets of the first act, and experience the full power that awaits you in the full game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break Destiny: Demo is an introduction to a roguelite RPG where every decision matters, and every mistake can cost you your life. In this short, ten-minute journey, you'll face fate in a series of tactical 1v1 duels, learning the basics of the combat system, professions, and exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Demo</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration up to level 10</strong> \u2013 a fragment of the game's first act, where you'll learn the foundations of the world and mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chosen Hero</strong> \u2013 begin your journey with one of the pre-made characters and learn to fight the curse of fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full combat mechanics</strong> \u2013 alternating turns, status effects, abilities, and decisions that determine life and death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No saves or fate points</strong> \u2013 every defeat is the end of this journey\u2026 but only the beginning of your true story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Encyclopedia</strong> \u2013 discover a foretaste of the secrets of the world and systems you'll develop in the full game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Consistent difficulty</strong> \u2013 focus on tactics and strategy without distracting options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the world before you conquer it.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is only the first step towards power. Every turn, every strike, and every decision in the demo is a preview of the depth that awaits in the full game. If you survive the test\u2026 you'll discover that this is only the beginning of the fight for your destiny.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4112280?t=1761585829","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112280/c138ad9aee95324d34f53d756bc8abf20ed0bbcf/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761585829","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112280/cd3c1837b9c84f9e204afb8c603bb371429adcb1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761585829","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112280/cd3c1837b9c84f9e204afb8c603bb371429adcb1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761585829","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a world of tactical duels and dark destiny. Learn the basics of gameplay, uncover the secrets of the first act, and experience the full power that awaits you in the full game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break Destiny: Demo is an introduction to a roguelite RPG where every decision matters, and every mistake can cost you your life. In this short, ten-minute journey, you'll face fate in a series of tactical 1v1 duels, learning the basics of the combat system, professions, and exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Demo</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration up to level 10</strong> \u2013 a fragment of the game's first act, where you'll learn the foundations of the world and mechanics.</p><p class=\